<li><b>Amatriciana Tradizionale STG</b>, Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2020/395 of 6 March 2020: 18–30% Amatrice guanciale, 69–81% tomato, olive oil, salt, white wine, and chilli or pepper to taste.</li>
